    developer: Some("Tose"),
    description: Some("Shinnosuke is left minding his baby sister, loses her, and must find her before their mother gets home. Each area holds a minigame — fourteen in all, ten carried over from earlier games in the series and four new. Clearing one gives a password; some hand over an item that helps at the athletics meet. Losing to Buriburizaemon voids a minigame you had already cleared."),
